<title>JAPAN: NTT shares climb to new 1997 high.</title>
<headline>NTT shares climb to new 1997 high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) climbed to a new high for calendar 1997 in Friday morning trade as investors kept looking for shares which are orientated towards domestic demand, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0042 GMT, the shares were up 40,000 yen at 1.07 million yen.</p>
